   "text": "Interruption and resume",
   "originalText": "Interruption and resume",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e147",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 147,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 147,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [],
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 1090,
   "width": 576,
   "height": 135.0,
   "text": "A pause (O3 confirm policy, approve pack, approve letter) is a LangGraph\ninterrupt saved with the card in the checkpoint (Neon Postgres).\nPOST /api/resume answers it. Any other turn or button first gets 409\n'Answer the card on screen first.'\nClosing the browser or restarting the server keeps the pause: reopening the\nthread shows the same card (V-34).\nNo process waits for the insurer or the bank. M1 reads the connector each\ntime the thread is opened, and a signed webhook triggers the same refresh.\nOne thread never runs twice at once (per-thread lock in the API).",
   "originalText": "A pause (O3 confirm policy, approve pack, approve letter) is a LangGraph\ninterrupt saved with the card in the checkpoint (Neon Postgres).\nPOST /api/resume answers it. Any other turn or button first gets 409\n'Answer the card on screen first.'\nClosing the browser or restarting the server keeps the pause: reopening the\nthread shows the same card (V-34).\nNo process waits for the insurer or the bank. M1 reads the connector each\ntime the thread is opened, and a signed webhook triggers the same refresh.\nOne thread never runs twice at once (per-thread lock in the API).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e148",
